msgid ""
"**Description**: Get pharmacogenomics alleles and their functional status"
" for a gene from CPIC. Returns allele names, activity values, and "
"functional status. Note: use 'clinicalfunctionalstatus' field for the "
"active clinical classification (e.g., 'No function', 'Normal function'); "
"the 'functionalstatus' field may be null for some genes. Critical for "
